# Emptiness evoked with a Mox Pearl ({W}) and a Mox Jet ({B}): one white and one black mana were spent, neither {W}{W} nor
# {B}{B}, so only the evoke sacrifice trigger happens. The Llanowar Elves stay in the graveyard (compare
# emptiness-evoked-with-white-white-still-returns-the-creature-before-its-sacrifice), nobody is asked for a target, and
# Emptiness is sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Faithless Looting
Emptiness
Island x2
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves; Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Emptiness.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet
Bot1.Graveyard = Emptiness; Faithless Looting; Island; Llanowar Elves
